{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026j6pgSj79aO1794544326.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>近期一眾本地快餐、零售及收租股，走勢都跑贏大市，而且派息率不低。股評人張智威認為，經濟動力稍微放緩的時候，資金有時候會追捧快餐股，如大家樂，但近期升勢過急，不宜現價高追。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:29.214779+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":85,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-13T04:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-13T23:43:01.395413+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-13T05:29:51.631585+00:00","content_hash":"f583e3955672f3be217a7c2eeadb7b6120a3f81e828fb71cdb56452c6ac78eb8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-13T05:36:29.214779+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}